<h2>Before you call it finished, check:</h2>
<ul>
    <li>The number of characters</li>
    <li>Names and species</li>
    <li>Fur, face, and ear details</li>
    <li>Clothing and accessories</li>
    <li>Relative size between characters</li>
    <li>The location</li>
    <li>The story action actually shown</li>
    <li>The palette — no gold, ever</li>
    <li>No accidental text or watermarks</li>
    <li>An accessibility description is written</li>
</ul>
<p>Save the prompt, the result, your corrections, and your final approval together — that record is what makes the next story easier than this one.</p>

